# Portfolio Project Structure

This is a Next.js 14 portfolio website for Luís Henrique Wendt, a Full Stack Developer with modern design using shadcn/ui and dark theme.

## Project Architecture

### Main Entry Points
- Main page: [src/app/page.tsx](mdc:src/app/page.tsx) - Portfolio layout with Header, Profile, AboutMe, Projects, and Footer components
- Layout: [src/app/layout.tsx](mdc:src/app/layout.tsx) - Root layout with Lexend font, Portuguese language, and dark theme
- Global styles: [src/app/globals.css](mdc:src/app/globals.css) - Tailwind CSS with shadcn/ui theme variables

### Component Structure
All components are located in [src/components/](mdc:src/components/) with individual directories:
- [Header/](mdc:src/components/Header/) - Fixed navigation with minimal logo and social links
- [Profile/](mdc:src/components/Profile/) - Hero section with developer info and skills badges
- [AboutMe/](mdc:src/components/AboutMe/) - About section with skills grid and professional background
- [GitHubStats/](mdc:src/components/GitHubStats/) - Dynamic GitHub statistics via API integration
- [RecentActivity/](mdc:src/components/RecentActivity/) - Recent commits and activity from GitHub API
- [Degrees/](mdc:src/components/Degrees/) - Projects showcase with modern card design
- [Footer/](mdc:src/components/Footer/) - Minimal footer with social links and copyright
- [ui/](mdc:src/components/ui/) - shadcn/ui components (Button, Card, Badge)

### Assets
- Images: [src/img/](mdc:src/img/) - Profile photo and project logos
- Public files: [public/](mdc:public/) - Resume PDF and Next.js assets

### Configuration
- [package.json](mdc:package.json) - Dependencies: Next.js 14, React 18, shadcn/ui, Lucide React, Framer Motion, TypeScript
- [tailwind.config.ts](mdc:tailwind.config.ts) - Tailwind with shadcn/ui theme, dark mode, and custom container
- [next.config.mjs](mdc:next.config.mjs) - Next.js configuration
- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json) - TypeScript configuration with path aliases
- [components.json](mdc:components.json) - shadcn/ui configuration

## Design System
- Theme: Dark theme as default with shadcn/ui color system
- Typography: Lexend font family with hierarchical sizing
- Language: Portuguese (pt-br)
- Layout: Container-based responsive design with consistent spacing
- Components: shadcn/ui components with consistent styling
- Animations: Framer Motion for smooth, modern interactions and transitions